# What EAS Build archives before uploading, from apps/mobile as the app root
# (per Expo's monorepo guide). Without this file EAS falls back to .gitignore
# — but only the one found starting from this directory, so a sibling
# workspace's build cache that's gitignored at the repo ROOT (not here) still
# gets swept into the archive. apps/web/.next hit 8.6GB and stalled
# "Compressing project files" for 10+ minutes with a killed, hung-looking
# build — this is the fix, not a guess: confirmed by du -sh before writing it.
#
# Keep every workspace's package.json reachable (npm workspace resolution
# needs them at install time) — only their build output and dependencies are
# excluded here, never their source.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
.git/

# Sibling workspaces: their installed deps and build artifacts, never needed
# to build the mobile app.
../api/.venv/
../api/.venv-check/
../api/tts_cache/
../web/.next/
../web/node_modules/
